# Next.js Patterns

- List page (`app/page.tsx`) is a client exception — TanStack Query + type filter
- Detail/compare default to Server Components where possible
- Sync list **type + offset** to URL (`/?type=fire&offset=40`)
- Static routes (`/compare`) alongside dynamic `[name]`
- Colocate `loading.tsx`, `error.tsx`, `not-found.tsx` with routes
- Use `next/image` for sprites when optimizing; img ok for scaffold
